 "what": "Prioritizes which foreign markets to build NEW company-discovery sweeps for (layers 36+), using policy-rate gap vs India as one signal alongside existing twin coverage. Source: the author's own cross-border debt-issuance research, repurposed here for a different question (equity/capex expansion propensity, not bond arbitrage) -- see 'analysis_scope_note'.",
